---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import SpotifyNowPlaying from '../components/SpotifyNowPlaying.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Now · Dilith Dinesh"
  description="What Dilith Dinesh is currently building, reading, and thinking about, updated regularly."
>
  <!-- Last updated: Jul 2026. If you're reading this, hi. -->
  <div class="max-w-[740px] mx-auto px-6 pt-[120px] pb-[80px]">

    <h1 class="font-display text-[48px] font-medium leading-tight text-primary">Now</h1>

    <p class="font-body text-base text-secondary mt-3">
      What I'm working on, reading, and<br />
      thinking about, updated regularly.
    </p>

    <p class="font-body text-sm text-secondary mt-2">
      <span id="last-updated-trigger" style="cursor:pointer;">Last updated: Jul 2026</span><span id="last-updated-detail" style="display:none; font-style:italic;"> Specifically: a Sunday evening. Some things don't change.</span>
    </p>

    <script>
      document.getElementById('last-updated-trigger').addEventListener('click', () => {
        const detail = document.getElementById('last-updated-detail');
        detail.style.display = detail.style.display === 'none' ? 'inline' : 'none';
        window.markEggFound?.('now-date-reveal');
      });
    </script>

    <SpotifyNowPlaying />

    <hr class="border-t border-border my-[80px]" />

    <!-- Currently Building -->
    <section class="mb-[80px]">
      <h2 class="font-display text-[32px] font-medium leading-snug text-primary mb-6">Currently Building</h2>

      <div class="mb-6">
        <p class="font-body text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-secondary mb-2">Starting August 2026</p>
        <p class="font-body text-base text-primary leading-relaxed">
          Joining VoiceStack as an Associate Product Manager, working on AI-powered phone
          systems for dental practices and DSOs. New domain, new stakes.
          Right now the job is learning: how a practice actually runs its front
          desk, where the calls go, and what breaks between a ringing phone and
          a booked appointment.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mb-6">
        <p class="font-body text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-secondary mb-2">Closed out</p>
        <p class="font-body text-base text-primary leading-relaxed">
          Two years at Zuper ended in July. The roofing vertical is live and
          cloneable, and the booking work is in the product team's hands.
          Both case studies stay up. They're the clearest record I have of
          how I think.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p class="font-body text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-secondary mb-2">Side</p>
        <p class="font-body text-base text-primary leading-relaxed">
          Iris: the web app is fully built. Now extending it to mobile.
          The mobile MVP exists; the real build is underway.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-6">
        <p class="font-body text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-secondary mb-2">Side</p>
        <p class="font-body text-base text-primary leading-relaxed">
          Voice agent live on the homepage, built as a proof-of-thinking
          for AI product work. Iterating on retrieval precision
          and fallback routing.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <hr class="border-t border-border mb-[80px]" />

    <!-- Currently Reading -->
    <section class="mb-[80px]">
      <h2 class="font-display text-[32px] font-medium leading-snug text-primary mb-6">Currently Reading</h2>

      <p class="font-body text-base text-primary leading-relaxed">
        A Gentleman in Moscow, by Amor Towles.
      </p>
      <p class="font-body text-base text-secondary mt-2 leading-relaxed">
        A count under house arrest in a grand hotel, building a full life within four walls.
        Elegant, unhurried, and the right kind of escape.
      </p>
    </section>

    <hr class="border-t border-border mb-[80px]" />

    <!-- Currently Thinking About -->
    <section class="mb-[80px]">
      <h2 class="font-display text-[32px] font-medium leading-snug text-primary mb-6">Currently Thinking About</h2>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <p class="font-body text-base text-primary leading-relaxed">
          → How much of a vertical do you actually have to live in before
          your product instincts are worth anything? I think the answer is
          longer than most people admit.
        </p>
        <p class="font-body text-base text-primary leading-relaxed">
          → When should a voice agent stop talking and hand the call to a
          person? Getting this wrong in one direction wastes staff time.
          Getting it wrong in the other loses a patient in pain.
        </p>
        <p class="font-body text-base text-primary leading-relaxed">
          → Every AI receptionist demos well. The ones that survive seem to
          win on unglamorous things: writing correctly into a practice
          management system, handling a name the transcriber mangles.
          I want to know if that holds.
        </p>
        <p class="font-body text-base text-primary leading-relaxed">
          → How do you design AI that steps back while still doing its job,
          reducing cognitive load for people under operational pressure
          instead of adding to it?
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <hr class="border-t border-border mb-[80px]" />

    <!-- Looking For -->
    <section>
      <h2 class="font-display text-[32px] font-medium leading-snug text-primary mb-6">Not Looking</h2>

      <p class="font-body text-base text-primary leading-relaxed">
        I just started somewhere I wanted to be, so I'm not taking recruiter calls.
      </p>

      <p class="font-body text-base text-primary leading-relaxed mt-4">
        Still glad to talk, just not about roles. Vertical SaaS, voice AI, what it
        actually takes to learn an industry from the inside, or anything I've written
        here that you think is wrong.
      </p>

      <a
        href="mailto:dilithdinesh007@gmail.com"
        class="font-body text-sm text-primary underline underline-offset-[3px] mt-6 inline-block transition-colors duration-150 hover:text-blue"
      >
        → dilithdinesh007@gmail.com
      </a>
    </section>

  </div>

  <!-- Direct /now navigation toast -->
  <script>
    (function() {
      if (sessionStorage.getItem('dd-now')) return;
      const fromInternal = document.referrer.includes('dilithdinesh.com');
      if (!fromInternal) {
        sessionStorage.setItem('dd-now', 'true');
        setTimeout(() => {
          window.markEggFound?.('now-direct', "You knew to look for a Now page. That tells me something about you.");
        }, 2000);
      }
    })();
  </script>
</Base>
